 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The 7th Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade rolls and floats down Broadway on Nov. 27, 1930. Photo: AP 🎈 The Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade in Manhattan is facing the threat of grounded balloons. The National Weather Service declared a "high wind watch" for NYC tomorrow morning. Wind grounded balloons in 1971 , but the parade has never been canceled due to weather. Get the latest . 🏈 The Pittsburgh Steelers are benching iconic QB Aaron Rodgers, despite holding a winning 6-4 record , and plan to start Mason Rudolph against the Denver Broncos in Black Friday's game. This is Rodgers' 22nd season in the NFL, which many expect to be his last. Go deeper . 🚙 The Pentagon  is in talks with GM, Ford and other manufacturers to help produce drones in an effort to use the car industry's assembly lines to boost production, The Wall Street Journal reports ( gift link ). 🌕 SpaceX won FCC approval to deploy 1 million satellites to help the company create data centers in space. Read the announcement . 
 
