 4. 🎮 1 fun thing: 2026&#x27;s best video games 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 "The Blood of Dawnwalker." Image: Rebel Wolves via AP 🕹️ "The Blood of Dawnwalker" and "Grand Theft Auto VI" top AP's list of 2026's best video games.

 The top five  also   include the tactical game "Star Wars Zero Company," the pixelated throwback "Mina the Hollower" and the survival shooter "Resident Evil Requiem." 📊 Stunning stat: "GTA VI" sold more than 47 million units by the end of its launch weekend, per Sensor Tower. 

 ☁️ Thought bubble from Axios' Herb Scribner : I haven't played "Blood of Dawnwalker," but I've spent a few hours playing "GTA VI."

 It's full of beautiful scenery, dynamic characters and compelling storylines. You want to be in the game driving around, running errands, completing missions. I can't wait to fly another plane and find one of the nine distinct endings . See the list ... Go deeper on "GTA VI." 

 
 
